**Given:**

The expression is: (20 × 13) × {4 ÷ 4 × (19 - 13) / 3}

**Formula Used:**

Follow the BODMAS rule (Brackets, Orders, Division, Multiplication, Addition, Subtraction).

**Calculation:**

⇒ (20 × 13) × {4 ÷ 4 × (19 - 13) / 3}

⇒ (20 × 13) × {4 ÷ 4 × 6 / 3}

⇒ (20 × 13) × {1 × 6 / 3}

⇒ (20 × 13) × 2

⇒ 20 × 13 = 260

⇒ 260 × 2 = 520

**The value of the expression is 520.**
